"Вы, вообще, ещё на Земле?"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Rescuer"
msgstr "Спасатель"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Rescuer"
msgstr "Спасательница"

#. ~ Profession (male Rescuer) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were ready.  You went in determined to find and rescue your friends.  "
"But now as you walk through those strange corridors, the atmosphere grows "
"heavy and you're not so sure anymore.  You might be the one in need of a "
"rescue now."
msgstr ""
"Вы подготовились. Вы решили найти и спасти своих друзей. Но теперь вы в этих"
" странных коридорах, воздух становится гуще, и вы больше ни в чём не "
"уверены. Возможно, это вас нужно спасать."

#. ~ Profession (female Rescuer) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were ready.  You went in determined to find and rescue your friends.  "
"But now as you walk through those strange corridors, the atmosphere grows "
"heavy and you're not so sure anymore.  You might be the one in need of a "
