#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Pillhead"
msgstr "Торчок"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Pillhead"
msgstr "Торчок"

#. ~ Profession (male Pillhead) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After an accident in your youth, you got addicted to the opiates treating "
"your pain.  With the pharmacies shut down and dealers turned undead, "
"satisfying your fix just got a lot more difficult."
msgstr ""
"После несчастного случая в молодости ты подсел на опиаты, облегчающие твою "
"боль. Аптеки теперь закрыты, продавцы превратились в зомби, и достать "
"лекарства стало намного сложнее."

#. ~ Profession (female Pillhead) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After an accident in your youth, you got addicted to the opiates treating "
