#. ~ Description for {'str': 'RM13 combat armor'}
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"Internally powered by a maximum of ten plutonium fuel cells, this full-body "
"suit of sleek black military armor represents the pinnacle of Rivtech's non-"
"rigid powered armor technology.  While inactive it can protect from most "
"pistol rounds.  When active, its powered ballistic shielding can shrug off "
"5.56x45mm.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr ""

