msgid ""
"A fully enclosed combat helmet for hazardous environments, this was designed"
" to fit with a powered exoskeleton, using cameras to expand visual range.  "
"In practice, the cameras were unreliable and easily fouled.  The "
"environmental controls function best with direct-skin contact."
