"Marijuana, cannabis, pot.  Whatever you want to call it, it's rolled up in a"
" piece of paper and ready for smokin'."
msgstr ""
"Марихуана, каннабис, травка. Называй как хочешь, оно скручено бумагой и "
"готово для курения."

#. ~ Use action activation_message for blunt.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You light up the blunt."
msgstr "Вы поджигаете блант."

#. ~ Description for blunt
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Marijuana, cannabis, pot.  Whatever you want to call it, it's rolled up in a"
