"on it will steadily charge all rechargeable batteries (battery cells, lead-"
"acid batteries, etc) placed directly within its storage space, at a greater "
"rate than most consumer chargers.  The system can only be installed onto "
"existing storage compartments, and is controlled from a dashboard or "
"electronics control unit."
msgstr ""
